てなくってね。","nextNodeIds":[740590109]},{"nodeId":740590109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4254234362,"text":"うぅ、それは予想外だな。この石にはなんらかの使い道があるって思ってたんだけど…","nextNodeIds":[740590110]},{"nodeId":740590110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5096,"speakerName":"チェシル","textMapHash":3546599994,"text":"使い道って言ったら、完全にないわけでもないが…","nextNodeIds":[740590126]},{"nodeId":740590126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"","textMapHash":760923690,"text":"そう言いながら、チェシルは機械時計をカウンターに並べた。","nextNodeIds":[740590111]},{"nodeId":740590111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5096,"speakerName":"チェシル","textMapHash":1910287354,"text":"見ろ、今回新しく作った機械時計。あの鉱石を使ってみたぞ。","nextNodeIds":[740590112]},{"nodeId":740590112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5096,"speakerName":"チェシル","textMapHash":1600366354,"text":"最初は自分に見る目がなかったせいにして、石を処分しようと思ったんだが…","nextNodeIds":[740590113]},{"nodeId":740590113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5096,"speakerName":"チェシル","textMapHash":847318218,"text":"加工の失敗した鉱石を見た時計職人さんたちが、鉱石の硬度が高い性質を見込んで、時計内部のコア部品として使ったのさ。","nextNodeIds":[740590114]},{"nodeId":740590114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5096,"speakerName":"チェシル","textMapHash":834444890,"text":"高い硬度によって摩耗への耐性が高いから、コア部品の材料としては、既存の材料よりも優れるってのが思いもよらない結果だ。","nextNodeIds":[740590115]},{"nodeId":740590115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5096,"speakerName":"チェシル","textMapHash":223455698,"text":"しかし、時計の部品に使われるとなると、より安定的な供給が必要となる…","nextNodeIds":[740590116,740590117]},{"nodeId":740590116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2710064258,"text":"それならなんとかなる…","nextNodeIds":[740590118]},{"nodeId":740590118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"暗転","textMapHash":2626660370,"text":"プーカと鉱脈についてチェシルに伝えた。","nextNodeIds":[740590119]},{"nodeId":740590119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5096,"speakerName":"チェシル","textMapHash":3884453946,"text":"なるほど、なんという偶然だ！このプロトタイプの時計は新しく発明された貝式防水構造が採用されていて、最初からメリュジーヌにも快適に使ってもらうために作られたんだ。","nextNodeIds":[740590120]},{"nodeId":740590120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5096,"speakerName":"チェシル","textMapHash":3445985450,"text":"こうなったら、この時計をプーカさんに届けてくれないか？ついでに前もって少し説明してもらえると助かる。","nextNodeIds":[740590121]},{"nodeId":740590121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5096,"speakerName":"チェシル","textMapHash":3292904146,"text":"私はメリュジーヌと取引した経験がないからな…もしプーカさんが安定した供給を保証してくれるなら、新たな生産ラインを構築できるぞ。","nextNodeIds":[740590122]},{"nodeId":740590122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5096,"speakerName":"チェシル","textMapHash":4236253298,"text":"後で、私から直接プーカさんを訪ねて相談するよ！時計のデザインに、メリュジーヌのスタイルを取り入れるのもよさそうだな…","nextNodeIds":[740590123]},{"nodeId":740590123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2232509290,"text":"へへっ、もし成功したら、プーカにとってもいいことだよな！","nextNodeIds":[740590124]},{"nodeId":740590124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":826950138,"text":"この機会をうまく利用すれば、プーカも自前の宝石工房を持てるかもしれない。プーカのところに戻って話してみようぜ！","nextNodeIds":[740590125]},{"nodeId":740590125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5096,"speakerName":"チェシル","textMapHash":816490418,"text":"それじゃ、よろしくな！","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":740590117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":116422274,"text":"直接プーカと連絡を取ったら…","nextNodeIds":[740590118]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7405901,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3","133403781,1"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_REFRESH_GROUP_SUITE"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCC